ont-serviceable modules. We design to the uptime and security requirements typical of Abu Dhabi government and energy-sector projects.\\\"}},{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Question\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"How long does delivery take for an Abu Dhabi project?\\\",\\\"acceptedAnswer\\\":{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Answer\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"Stocked panel series are typically on site within 1 to 2 weeks; custom pitches or curved builds take 3 to 6 weeks including factory production and QC. Installation windows are coordinated around building management and DMT requirements.\\\"}},{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Question\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Do you provide maintenance contracts in Abu Dhabi?\\\",\\\"acceptedAnswer\\\":{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Answer\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"Yes — annual maintenance covers preventive cleaning, calibration, module-level repairs and priority call-outs to Abu Dhabi, Al Ain and the Western Region. Government and mission-critical sites can opt for guaranteed response-time SLAs.\\\"}}]}a:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"main\\\",null,{\\\"data-testid\\\":\\\"next-server-rendered-parity-page\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"script\\\",\\\"0\\\",{\\\"type\\\":\\\"application/ld+json\\\",\\\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\\\":{\\\"__html\\\":\\\"{\\\\\\\"@context\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"https://schema.org\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"@type\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"WebPage\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"name\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"LED Screen Supplier Abu Dhabi | ADNOC-Trusted | Brightluxx\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"description\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"The LED screen supplier Abu Dhabi's biggest names trust \\\\\\\\u2014 we built ADNOC HQ's command center. Indoor, outdoor \\u0026 control-room LED with weekly capital installs. Get a same-day quote.\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"url\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"https://brightluxx.com/abu-dhabi\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"publisher\\\\\\\": {\\\\\\\"@type\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"Organization\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"name\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"Brightluxx\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"url\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"https://brightluxx.com\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"logo\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"https://files.ihgbrands.com/uploa