\\\\\"OM\\\\\\\"], \\\\\\\"availableLanguage\\\\\\\": [\\\\\\\"en\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"ar\\\\\\\"]}}\\\"}}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"script\\\",\\\"3\\\",{\\\"type\\\":\\\"application/ld+json\\\",\\\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\\\":{\\\"__html\\\":\\\"{\\\\\\\"@context\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"https://schema.org\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"@type\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"LocalBusiness\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"@id\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"https://brightluxx.com/#localbusiness\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"name\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"Brightluxx LED Displays\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"image\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"https://brightluxx.com/android-chrome-512x512.png\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"url\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"https://brightluxx.com\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"telephone\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"+971559954274\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"priceRange\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"AED 2,500 - AED 12,000 per m\\\\\\\\u00b2\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"address\\\\\\\": {\\\\\\\"@type\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"PostalAddress\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"streetAddress\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"Jebel Ali Industrial Area 1\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"addressLocality\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"Dubai\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"addressCountry\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"AE\\\\\\\"}, \\\\\\\"geo\\\\\\\": {\\\\\\\"@type\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"GeoCoordinates\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"latitude\\\\\\\": 24.9857, \\\\\\\"longitude\\\\\\\": 55.0272}, \\\\\\\"openingHoursSpecification\\\\\\\": {\\\\\\\"@type\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"OpeningHoursSpecification\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"dayOfWeek\\\\\\\": [\\\\\\\"Monday\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Tuesday\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Wednesday\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Thursday\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Friday\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Saturday\\\\\\\"], \\\\\\\"opens\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"09:00\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"closes\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"18:00\\\\\\\"}, \\\\\\\"areaServed\\\\\\\": [\\\\\\\"Dubai\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Abu Dhabi\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"United Arab Emirates\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Saudi Arabia\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Qatar\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Kuwait\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Bahrain\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Oman\\\\\\\"]}\\\"}}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"script\\\",\\\"4\\\",{\\\"type\\\":\\\"application/ld+json\\\",\\\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\\\":{\\\"__html\\\":\\\"$13\\\"}}]],\\\"$L14\\\"]}]\\n15:Te93,\\u003ch1\\u003eLED Screen Supplier Abu Dhabi | ADNOC-Trusted | Brightluxx\\u003c/h1\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eThe LED screen supplier Abu Dhabi's biggest names trust — we built ADNOC HQ's command center. Indoor, outdoor \\u0026amp; control-room LED with weekly capital installs. Get a same-day quote.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003ch2\\u003eAbu Dhabi Areas We Serve\\u003c/h2\\u003e\\u003cul\\u003e\\u003cli\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eCorniche \\u0026amp; Al Markaziyah\\u003c/strong\\u003e: Corporate towers and bank HQs — fine-pitch lobby walls including our ADNOC command center.\\u003c/li\\u003e\\u003cli\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eAl Maryah Island (ADGM)\\u003c/strong\\u003e: Financial-district lobbies and boardrooms with museum-grade MicroLED.\\u003c/li\\u003e\\u003cli\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eYas Island\\u003c/strong\\u003e: Entertainment, arenas and retail — high-refresh event and venue screens.\\u003c/li\\u003e\\u003cli\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eICAD \\u0026amp; Mussafah\\u003c/strong\\u003e: Industrial and logistics facilities — control-room and safety display systems.\\u003c/li\\u003e\\u003cli\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eKhalifa City \\u0026amp; Zayed City\\u003c/strong\\u003e: Community retail, clinics and education campuses.\\u003c/li\\u003e\\u003cli\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eAl Ain\\u003c/strong\\u003e: Covered by our weekly Abu Dhabi service runs for installs and maintenance.\\u003c/li\\u003e\\u003c/ul\\u003e\\u003ch2\\u003eAbu Dhabi Signage Regulations \\u0026amp; Power\\u003c/h2\\u003e\\u003ch3\\u003eDMT Signage Approval\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eOutdoor digital signage in Abu Dhabi is reviewed by the Department of Municipalities and Transport for brightness, content type and structural safety. We prepare the photometric and engineering submissions.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003ch3\\u003eADDED Signboard Rules\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eTrade-name signboards must align with Abu Dhabi Department of Economic Development guidelines — our designs are prepared to pass first review.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003ch3\\u003eADDC Power Coordination\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eLarger outdoor screens need approved load calculations and often a dedicated three-phase ADDC supply. We size the load and coordinate with your electrical contractor.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003ch2\\u003eAbu Dhabi Project Highlights\\u003c/h2\\u003e\\u003ch3\\u003eADNOC HQ Command Center\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eADNOC Headquarters, Corniche — Mission-critical control-room LED wall built for 24/7 operation with redundant power and processing.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003ch3\\u003eAbu Dhabi Expo Interactive Pavilion\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eADNEC, Abu Dhabi — Interactive LED pavilion combining touch-responsive floor and wall displays for a national exhibition.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003ch2\\u003eLED Display FAQs — Abu Dhabi\\u003c/h2\\u003e\\u003ch3\\u003eDo you deliver and install LED screens in Abu Dhabi?\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eYes — Abu Dhabi is served directly from our Dubai headquarters, roughly 90 minutes away. Site surveys, installation crews and after-sales visits are scheduled in the capital every week at no additional travel premium for standard projects.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003ch3\\u003eWhat approvals are needed for outdoor LED signage in Abu Dhabi?\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eOutdoor digital signage in Abu Dhabi is regulated by the Department of Municipalities and Transport (DMT), which reviews brightness, content type and structural safety. We supply the photometric reports and engineering drawings required for the application.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003ch3\\u003eCan you build control-room video walls for government entities?\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eYes — our ADNOC headquarters command-center installation is built for 24/7 operation with redundant power supplies, backup processing and front-serviceable modules. We design to the uptime and security requirements typical of Abu Dhabi government and energy-sector projects.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003ch3\\u003eHow long does delivery take for an Abu Dhabi project?\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eStocked panel series are typically on site within 1 to 2 weeks; custom pitches or curved builds take 3 to 6 weeks including factory production and QC. Installation windows are coordinated around building management and DMT requirements.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003ch3\\u003eDo you provide maintenance contracts in Abu Dhabi?\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eYes — annual maintenance covers preventive cleaning, calibration, module-level repairs and priority call-outs to Abu Dhabi, Al Ain and the Western Region. Government and mission-critical sites can opt for guaranteed response-time SLAs.\\u003c/p\\u003e14:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\\\":{\\\"__html\\\":\\\"$15\\\"}}]\\nf:[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"meta\\\",\\\"0\\\",{\\\"charSet\\\":\\\"utf-8\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"meta\\\",\\\"1\\\",{\\\"name\\\":\\\"viewport\\\",\\\"content\\\":\\\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\\\"}]]\\nc:null\\n11:[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"title\\\",\\\"0\\\",{\\\"children\\\":\\\"LED Screen Supplier Abu Dhabi | ADNOC-Trusted | Brightluxx\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"meta\\\",\\\"1\\\",{\\\"name\\\":\\\"description\\\",\\\"content\\\":\\\"The LED screen supplier Abu Dhabi's biggest names trust — we built ADNOC HQ's command center. Indoor, outdoor \\u0026 control-room LED with weekly capital installs. Get a same-day quote.\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"link\\\",\\\"2\\\",{\\\"rel\\\":\\\"canonical\\\",\\\"href\\\":\\\"https://brightluxx.com/abu-dhabi\\\"}]]\\n\"])</script></body></html>","rsc":"1:\"$Sreact.fragment\"\n2:\"$Sreact.suspense\"\n3:I[31262,[\"/_next/static/chunks/26-f67wugqpdn.js\"],\"PageViewTracker\"]\n4:I[48303,[\"/_next/static/chunks/26-f67wugqpdn.js\"],\"SiteHeader\"]\n5:I[39756,[\"/_next/static/chunks/26-f67wugqpdn.js\"],\"default\"]\n6:I[37457,[\"/_next/static/chunks/26-f67wugqpdn.js\"],\"default\"]\n7:I[22016,[\"/_next/static/chunks/26-f67wugqpdn.js\"],\"\"]\n8:I[52006,[\"/_next/static/chunks/26-f67wugqpdn.js\"],\"Fl