chunks/0war9uf8k1df9.css\",\"style\"]\n:HL[\"https://files.ihgbrands.com/assets_brightluxx-logo-nav.png\",\"image\"]\n10:Te93,<h1>LED Screen Supplier Abu Dhabi | ADNOC-Trusted | Brightluxx</h1><p>The LED screen supplier Abu Dhabi's biggest names trust — we built ADNOC HQ's command center. Indoor, outdoor &amp; control-room LED with weekly capital installs. Get a same-day quote.</p><h2>Abu Dhabi Areas We Serve</h2><ul><li><strong>Corniche &amp; Al Markaziyah</strong>: Corporate towers and bank HQs — fine-pitch lobby walls including our ADNOC command center.</li><li><strong>Al Maryah Island (ADGM)</strong>: Financial-district lobbies and boardrooms with museum-grade MicroLED.</li><li><strong>Yas Island</strong>: Entertainment, arenas and retail — high-refresh event and venue screens.</li><li><strong>ICAD &amp; Mussafah</strong>: Industrial and logistics facilities — control-room and safety display systems.</li><li><strong>Khalifa City &amp; Zayed City</strong>: Community retail, clinics and education campuses.</li><li><strong>Al Ain</strong>: Covered by our weekly Abu Dhabi service runs for installs and maintenance.</li></ul><h2>Abu Dhabi Signage Regulations &amp; Power</h2><h3>DMT Signage Approval</h3><p>Outdoor digital signage in Abu Dhabi is reviewed by the Department of Municipalities and Transport for brightness, content type and structural safety. We prepare the photometric and engineering submissions.</p><h3>ADDED Signboard Rules</h3><p>Trade-name signboards must align with Abu Dhabi Department of Economic Development guidelines — our designs are prepared to pass first review.</p><h3>ADDC Power Coordination</h3><p>Larger outdoor screens need approved load calculations and often a dedicated three-phase ADDC supply. We size the load and coordinate with your electrical contractor.</p><h2>Abu Dhabi Project Highlights</h2><h3>ADNOC HQ Command Center</h3><p>ADNOC Headquarters, Corniche — Mission-critical control-room LED wall built for 24/7 operation with redundant power and processing.</p><h3>Abu Dhabi Expo Interactive Pavilion</h3><p>ADNEC, Abu Dhabi — Interactive LED pavilion combining touch-responsive floor and wall displays for a national exhibition.</p><h2>LED Display FAQs — Abu Dhabi</h2><h3>Do you deliver and install LED screens in Abu Dhabi?</h3><p>Yes — Abu Dhabi is served directly from our Dubai headquarters, roughly 90 minutes away. Site surveys, installation crews and after-sales visits are scheduled in the capital every week at no additional travel premium for standard projects.</p><h3>What approvals are needed for outdoor LED signage in Abu Dhabi?</h3><p>Outdoor digital signage in Abu Dhabi is regulated by the Department of Municipalities and Transport (DMT), which reviews brightness, content type and structural safety. We supply the photometric reports and engineering drawings required for the application.</p><h3>Can you build control-room video walls for government entities?</h3><p>Yes — our ADNOC headquarters command-center installation is built for 24/7 operation with redundant power supplies, backup processing and front-serviceable modules. We design to the uptime and security requirements typical of Abu Dhabi government and energy-sector projects.</p><h3>How long does delivery take for an Abu Dhabi project?</h3><p>Stocked panel series are typically on site within 1 to 2 weeks; custom pitches or curved builds take 3 to 6 weeks including factory production and QC. Installation windows are coordinated around building management and DMT requirements.</p><h3>Do you provide maintenance contracts in Abu Dhabi?</h3><p>Yes — annual maintenance covers preventive cleaning, calibration, module-level repairs and priority call-outs to Abu Dhabi, Al Ain and the Western Region. Government and mission-critical sites can opt for guaranteed response-time SLAs.</p>3:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$10\"}}]\n4:[\"$\",\"$L11\",null,{\"children\":[\"$\",\"$12\",null,{\"name\":\"Next.MetadataOutlet\"